": 2, "username": "Noah"}]}, "discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_id": null, "discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_url": "https://your-url.zendesk.com/agent/tickets/", "draft": null, "draft_key": "topic_5142", "draft_sequence": null, "fancy_title": "Uniswap Governance Forum Rules", "featured_link": null, "has_accepted_answer": false, "has_cached_summary": false, "has_livestream": null, "has_summary": false, "highest_post_number": 3, "id": 5142, "image_url": null, "last_posted_at": "2020-09-21T19:33:07.761Z", "like_count": 47, "message_bus_last_id": 3, "participant_count": 1, "pinned": true, "pinned_at": "2020-09-21T19:33:33.035Z", "pinned_globally": true, "pinned_until": "3020-09-21T12:00:00.000Z", "post_stream": {"posts": [{"accepted_answer": false, "actions_summary": [{"count": 47, "id": 2}], "admin": false, "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/gov.uniswap.org/noah/{size}/225_2.png", "badges_granted": [], "bookmarked": false, "calendar_details": [], "can_accept_answer": false, "can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "can_view_edit_history": true, "can_vote": false, "can_wiki": false, "cooked": "<p>This forum is dedicated to discussions on Uniswap governance. Relevant topics include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Governance Proposals</li>\n<li>Proposal Discussions</li>\n<li>Delegation Pitches</li>\n<li>Site Feedback</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This is <strong>not</strong> the place for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>UNI price discussion</li>\n<li>Generic Uniswap discussion</li>\n<li>Uniswap support requests</li>\n<li>Off-topic conversations</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you need technical help, or want a place for more general discussion, visit the official Uniswap Discord.</p>\n<p>If your signal-to-noise ratio gets too low, <strong>you will be banned</strong>. Moderators will remove posts that are offensive, asking for UNI, or are otherwise irrelevant to this forum.</p>\n<h1><a name=\"p-11323-common-questions-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-11323-common-questions-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Common Questions</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://gov.uniswap.org/t/learn-requirements-how-to-claim-your-400-uni/1025\">How can I claim UNI?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://uniswap.org/blog/uni/\">Where can I learn more about UNI?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://app.uniswap.org/#/vote\">Where can I vote for governance proposals?</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h1><a name=\"p-11323-resources-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-11323-resources-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Resources</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://uniswap.org/\">Uniswap website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://uniswap.org/faq\">Uniswap FAQ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://uniswap.org/docs/v2/\">Documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Uniswap\">Github</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/UniswapProtocol\">Twitter</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>UNI FORUMS PINK BANNER</p>\n<p>Welcome to the official Uniswap Governance Forums!</p>\n<p>Below we have provided a template on how to structure your Uniswap proposals in order to offer a more comprehensive &amp; efficient deliberation process.</p>\n<h2><a name=\"p-11323-proposal-structure-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-11323-proposal-structure-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Proposal Structure</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Title: [Enter Proposal Title]</li>\n<li>Author(s): [enter name(s) of associated authors]</li>\n<li>Related Discussions: [paste link here]</li>\n<li>Submission Date: [Enter Date]</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Body Paragraphs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Simple Summary: Give us a TL;DR on your proposal; no more than 2-3 sentences.</li>\n<li>Abstract: Introduce and expand on the proposal. Highlight key points on how the proposal will improve stakeholder/tokenholder experience, protocol performance, and the overall implementation process.</li>\n<li>Motivation: What problems will this proposal address/solve? What’s the value-add?</li>\n<li>Specification &amp; Rationale: Go all-out and explain the rationale &amp; vision for the proposal! How will this affect the protocol both technically, socially, financially (if applicable), and governance-wise?</li>\n<li>Benefits (Pros): Provide benefits as to how the proposal implementation will advance the protocol.</li>\n<li>Downside (Cons): Are there any disadvantages with implementing the proposal?</li>\n<li>Voting: Define what a “yes” and “no” vote entails. If there are any Snapshot votes or forum polls associated with this proposal, please attach it.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a name=\"p-11323-governance-process-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-11323-governance-process-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Governance Process</h2>\n<p>For the sake of transparency, accountability, and consensus we would like to structure a cohesive flow that will assist with the transmission of governance proposals, temperature &amp; consensus checks, and high-traction proposals.</p>\n<p>Please, provide TLDR update on the top of your proposal so it is more easily accessible</p>\n<p>Here is a quick outline of how the governance process works:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Submit a forum post (<a href=\"https://gov.uniswap.org/c/proposal-discussion/5\">Proposal Discussion section</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Get in touch with Uniswap Discord Admins to discuss your proposal in a community call and on Twitter Space as well.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Create another forum post in the Temperature Check section and publish a <a href=\"https://snapshot.org/\">snapshot</a> (temperature check) vote with 2-5 days voting time. This action requires at least 1K UNI tokens <a href=\"https://docs.uniswap.org/protocol/concepts/governance/guide-to-voting\">delegated or self-delegated</a>. For the snapshot to be valid, at least 25k UNI should participate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Update the temperature check post incorporating community feedback.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Publish a <a href=\"https://snapshot.org/\">snapshot</a> (consensus check).This action requires at least 1K UNI tokens delegated or self-delegated. The snapshot would be deemed valid if at least 50K UNI participates</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Escalate the proposal to an on-chain vote. It is required to have at least 2,5M UNI delegated to do it. <a href=\"https://www.fish.vote/\">Fish.vote</a> gives smaller holders a chance to congregate and gather enough votes to push proposals on-chain.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Stay updated by subscribing to our <a href=\"https://uniletters.org/\">community bi-weekly newsletter</a> and follow our <a href=\"https://twitter.com/govbot_uniswap\">Twitter Governance Bot! </a></p>", "created_at": "2020-09-21T19:33:07.761Z", "current_user_reaction": null, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "deleted_at": null, "display_username": "Noah Zinsmeister", "edit_reason": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "hidden": false, "id": 11323, "incoming_link_count": 923, "link_counts": [{"clicks": 537, "internal": true, "reflection": false, "title": "[Learn] Requirements & How to claim your 400 UNI", "url": "https://gov.uniswap.org/t/learn-requirements-how-to-claim-your-400-uni/1025"}, {"clicks": 291, "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Uniswap Interface", "url": "https://app.uniswap.org/#/vote"}, {"clicks": 150, "internal": false, "reflection": false, "url": "https://uniswap.org/"}, {"clicks": 100, "internal": false, "reflection": false, "url": "https://uniswap.org/blog/uni/"}, {"clicks": 81, "internal": false, "reflection": false, "url": "https://uniswap.org/docs/v2/"}, {"clicks": 80, "internal": false, "reflection": false, "url": "https://uniswap.org/faq"}, {"clicks": 41, "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Fish.vote", "url": "https://www.fish.vote/"}, {"clicks": 35, "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Snapshot", "url": "https://snapshot.org/"}, {"clicks": 34, "internal": false, "reflection": false, "url": "https://twitter.com/UniswapProtocol"}, {"clicks": 28, "internal": false, "reflection